def about_page():
 s=hero('About XUYI: Plastic Drinkware Supply in Taizhou','台州市旭一家居用品有限公司 (XUYI Drinkware) focuses on reusable plastic sports bottles, kids water bottles, large-capacity jugs and shaker bottles for wholesale and brand-customization projects. We operate our own facility and can coordinate selected group/partner resources as required by the product.','COMPANY PROFILE · TAIZHOU ZHEJIANG CHINA','/media/ppt/slide-049.webp','XUYI colorful plastic water bottle product range',caption='Original XUYI plastic bottle catalog photography')
 s+='<section class="rs-section"><div class="shell rs-about__intro"><div>'+heading('THE COMPANY','Focused Product Range. Organized Project Delivery.')+'<p>Our business connects the right plastic bottle model with the buyer’s specifications. A retailer may need shelf-ready packaging, a distributor may need reliable model revisions, and a brand may need new artwork, color references or a custom closure.</p><p>XUYI is based in Taizhou, Zhejiang, China. The organization has factory-backed manufacturing capability and can coordinate selected group and partner production routes, with each model’s supply route checked during sourcing. We do not treat every group photo, equipment item or certification as a separate XUYI facility asset without project-specific verification.</p><p>Our public offer covers plastic drinkware in this project. Stainless-steel and glass catalog lines from other group websites are not silently mixed into XUYI’s plastic product catalog.</p><a class="rs-textlink" href="/why-us/">Why choose XUYI for sourcing? ↗</a></div><div class="rs-about__fact"><span class="eyebrow">COMPANY AT A GLANCE</span><dl><div><dt>Business base</dt><dd>Taizhou, Zhejiang, China</dd></div><div><dt>Main products</dt><dd>Sports, kids, jugs & shakers</dd></div><div><dt>Sales model</dt><dd>Wholesale / OEM / ODM inquiry</dd></div><div><dt>Production model</dt><dd>Own facility + selected partners</dd></div><div><dt>Supplier evaluation</dt><dd>Model, sample, QA and pack review</dd></div></dl></div></div></section>'
 s+='<section class="rs-section rs-section--dark"><div class="shell">'+heading('GROUP MANUFACTURING REFERENCES','Photos from Packing, Quality and Logistics Operations','Our group-site visual library supports the sourcing story. Captions identify the process represented; exact equipment and documentation for an XUYI plastic SKU are confirmed during the project.')+'<div class="rs-about__gallery"><div>'+photo_block('/media/group/factory-bottle-packing.webp','Group workshop staff handling crates and packing preparation','Production-area and packing handling')+'</div><div>'+photo_block('/media/group/qa-color-box.webp','Group laboratory color assessment light box used for quality reference','Quality review instrumentation')+'</div><div>'+photo_block('/media/group/factory-shipment.webp','Group warehouse racking for prepared orders','Warehouse and shipping coordination')+'</div><div>'+photo_block('/media/group/factory-final-pack.webp','Group packed goods awaiting dispatch','Finished product protection')+'</div></div><p class="rs-disclaimer">These images originate from the group websites. They are illustrative of group resources and do not on their own establish machine ownership, a specific plastic molding line, certification, production capacity or individual SKU test results.</p></div></section>'
 s+='<section class="rs-section"><div class="shell">'+heading('WHAT WE SUPPLY','Four Plastic Product Collections','No metal or glass products are inserted into these plastic category pages.')+product_grid()+'</div></section>'
 stages=[('01','Review the brief','Confirm the intended users, destination, model or desired form.'),('02','Validate the model','Match capacity, lid, component materials and actual catalog photos.'),('03','Approve customization','Check color, artwork, packaging and feasible structural changes.'),('04','Verify before production','Use samples, quality requirements and order-approved records.'),('05','Coordinate dispatch','Reconcile carton measurements, documents and transport terms.')]
 s+='<section class="rs-section rs-section--soft"><div class="shell">'+heading('HOW WE SUPPORT THE BUYER','A Practical Supply Workflow')+'<div class="rs-about__steps">'+''.join('<article><b>'+n+'</b><h3>'+e(title)+'</h3><p>'+e(detail)+'</p></article>' for n,title,detail in stages)+'</div></div></section>'
 s+='<section class="rs-section"><div class="shell">'+heading('EXPLORE MORE','Documents and Services Behind the Products')+grid_links(LINKS)+'</div></section>'
